OL,3,ALindsay Clancy to face retrial next
OL,4,Ayear for deaths of her three children
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This story contains details
OL,7,Fsome readers may find distressing.
OL,9,FLindsay Clancy, the Massachusetts woman
OL,10,Faccused of murdering her three
OL,11,Fchildren, will face a retrial next
OL,12,Fyear, a judge has said, after a jury
OL,13,Fdeadlocked last time in a case that
OL,14,Fgripped the nation.
OL,16,FThe judge set a trial date for 29 March
OL,17,F2027, though the district attorney did
OL,18,Fnot explicitly say what charges Clancy
OL,19,Fwould face.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
