OL,3,ALindsay Clancy to face retrial next
OL,4,Ayear for deaths of her three children
OL,5,
OL,6,FProsecutors said they wanted a jury
OL,7,Ftrial, and the defence said they took
OL,8,Fthat to mean Clancy, 36, would again
OL,9,Fface first-degree murder charges.
